  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Estimating access to education for internally displaced children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research project to estimate access to education for internally displaced children. The overall objective of the project was to raise awareness of the need to improve the availability and quality of data on internally displaced children and their education needs in order to foster more tailored and effective investments that support their access to quality education. In addition to identifying available data, tools and data gaps, the project highlighted ways forward to bridge remaining data gaps.</narrative>
  </description>
